                "text": "The President is deeply unpopular. His agenda is stunningly unpopular. The Big Ugly Bill \u2014 with its vast cuts to healthcare to fund tax cuts for the rich \u2014 is historically unpopular. \n\nSo Trump leveraged Republicans in Texas to try to gerrymander a majority in the midterms.\n\nBut they poked the bear. And California is going to fight back.",
