                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "22 million Americans are facing major price hikes for their health care, thanks to Donald Trump and his Big Ugly Bill.\n\nThe Republican budget means huge cuts to Medicaid, rural hospital closures, and higher out-of-pocket costs for families across the nation. Together, these failures will force millions of Americans to go without health insurance. \n\nAll to pay for big billionaire tax breaks.",
